    "title": "15 active legal licenses in Graham County as of March",
    "text": "Elizabeth Schmitt Young Lawyers Division President at the State Bar of Arizona | law.lclark.edu\nElizabeth Schmitt Young Lawyers Division President at the State Bar of Arizona | law.lclark.edu\naccording to the State Bar of Arizona.\nThis is unchanged from February.\nWithin Graham County, Safford had the highest number of lawyers with active licenses during March (13).\nData refers to all lawyers who were actively practicing during this period.\nAs of March 2024, the average annual salary for a lawyer in Arizona is around $99,098 per year, which is just below the nationwide average.\nLawyer Name | Name of Firm |\n---|---|\nC Robert Pursley | -- |\nChannen G. Day | Law Office of Channen Day PC |\nDavid B. Griffith | -- |\nDennis P. McCarthy | Law Office of Dennis McCarthy LLC |\nJ Grant Walker | J Grant Walker PLLC |\nJean Anne Roof | Graham County Attorney |\nJeremy J. Waite | Jeremy J. Waite |\nJohn Winslow Griffith | Graham County Attorney's Office |\nJosephine Y. Lopez | Law Office of Josi Y. Lopez, PC |\nKelly G. Black | J. Grant Walker, PLLC |\nLarson Scott Bennett | Graham County Attorney |\nLeven B. Ferrin | -- |\nMatt N. Clifford | Law Office of Matt N. Clifford P.C. |\nRebecca Riddle Johnson | Law Office of Rebecca R Johnson |\nRobert C. Standage | Graham County Attorney's Office |",
